WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.360
Speaker 1: We finally found one of these so-called
dead voters from the 2020 election.

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:11.110
Turns out it was a Republican voting under
the name of his deceased wife.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:12.509
This has been one of the stories.

00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:16.400
This is one of the stories we've been told
now for a very long time, but it really scaled

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.369
up with the November of 2020 election.

00:00:18.369 --> 00:00:21.710
Dead people are voting now, not literally
dead people.

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:28.099
People who are dead are showing up as having
voted, and this is clearly some kind of major

00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:30.220
fraud being perpetrated.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:35.780
It's part of the theft of the election by
Joe Biden from Donald Trump now before even

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:40.020
analyzing and before telling you about the
story and before analyzing the broader data

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.150
around dead people voting.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:49.510
It should be mentioned that even if their
claims were true of widespread dead people

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:56.570
voting, they would also have to show and prove
that it's happening in a way that helped Joe

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:58.790
Biden and hurt Donald Trump.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:03.690
You could have 10000 so-called dead people
voting, but if it was 5000 dead people voting

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:08.370
for Trump and 5000 dead people voting for
Biden, it doesn't actually make a difference

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:09.370
in the election.

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:13.770
So absent from many of these discussions is
OK.

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:15.300
Part one is is it true?

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:21.160
But Part two, if true, is it happening in
a Partizan way where it would actually help

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:22.650
one candidate rather than the other?

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:25.500
The answer to all of the above is it's not
actually happening, and we're going to get

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:26.680
to that in a second.

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:32.890
But as is often the case with these stories,
the side shouting about the supposed fraud

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:37.140
in this case, dead people voting is the only
side that's getting caught doing it.

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:39.490
This is a story out of Nevada.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:43.600
We previously mentioned this to you in a list
of examples of Republicans doing this.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:48.100
He has now been sentenced Nevada man who voted
twice using dead wife's ballot.

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.540
Sentenced to probation.

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.070
And fined $2000.

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:55.860
This is Donald Kirk Hartl, who has accepted
a plea deal to avoid jail time.

00:01:55.860 --> 00:02:01.210
A judge on Tuesday sentenced the Las Vegas
man to probation on a charge he voted twice

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:05.890
in the 2020 election by mailing in his deceased
wife's ballot.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:10.830
The I-Team was first to report that Kirk Hartel,
55 years old, was facing two charges relating

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.380
to last year's election.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:16.200
In court Tuesday, Hartl pleaded guilty to
one charge of voting more than once in the

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.200
same election.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.000
He appeared virtually in court.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.250
He was also fined two grand as part of the
plea agreement.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:27.170
The original Category D felony carried a maximum
prison sentence of four years, gets probation

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.260
and two grand.

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:33.640
Ultimately, to me, this seems like a cheap
political stunt that backfired and shows our

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:36.920
voting system actually works because you were
ultimately caught.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:41.100
That's what his that's what the judge in the
case said.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:46.400
Rosemary Hartel died in 2017 at age 52 from
breast cancer.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:53.860
Kirk Hartl is surviving husband A ballot for
Rosemary was issued in October and was received

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.160
by the county.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.860
But Kirk said the ballot never came to his
house.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:02.120
The I-Team found that even though Rosemary
died in 2017, her name appeared on the active

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.209
voter list.

00:03:03.209 --> 00:03:08.260
Kirk Hartle says I would like to say I accept
full responsibility for my actions and regret

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:12.069
them, and I'm thankful for your consideration.

00:03:12.069 --> 00:03:18.620
So we finally found the dead people voting
and it was a Republican.

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:21.300
Now this is an opportunity to remind you.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.640
First of all, there are people writing to
me saying the punishment should have been

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:27.520
far stricter, should have been much, much
stricter punishment here for this guy.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.050
OK, that's something that can be talked about.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.920
We have data we have done.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:35.780
There have been very good investigations done
into so-called dead people voting.

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:42.070
And it turns out that it's really easy and
popular to say 10000 people, 20000 30000 suspected

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:43.250
dead voters.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:46.180
The BBC actually investigated this.

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:52.371
There was an initial claim from Republicans
that, for example, in Michigan, 10000 dead

00:03:52.371 --> 00:03:53.371
people voted.

00:03:53.371 --> 00:03:55.910
They had this list of 10000 people that were
dead.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:57.810
The BBC did something very interesting.

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:01.129
They said, OK, from the 10000, let's pick
a random 30.

00:04:01.129 --> 00:04:03.769
Let's just take 30 names at random.

00:04:03.769 --> 00:04:06.209
And they started going through the 30 names.

00:04:06.209 --> 00:04:09.690
In fact, they did 31 names out of the 31.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:15.010
They spoke to 11 of the people and were able
to confirm they're still alive.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:20.859
So random group of 31 supposedly dead voters,
11 are just straight up, still alive.

00:04:20.859 --> 00:04:22.680
They found another 17.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:26.050
They weren't able to speak to them, but there
was no record of their death.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:27.620
There was no obituary.

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.150
There was no record anywhere.

00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:35.219
That said, these people have died and were
able to find, although they didn't speak to

00:04:35.219 --> 00:04:36.219
them.

00:04:36.219 --> 00:04:43.020
Evidence that they were alive, either records
or other interactions with the public or government

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:44.020
system.

00:04:44.020 --> 00:04:46.150
So that got them to 28.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:50.469
And then they found three people who were
dead.

00:04:50.469 --> 00:04:53.819
They were dead at the time that they checked.

00:04:53.819 --> 00:05:00.490
When they looked into it, the three people
were two of the three were alive at the time

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:03.220
that they voted, meaning they didn't do anything
wrong.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:08.949
OK, you could say, well, two of the people
died since sending their ballot shouldn't

00:05:08.949 --> 00:05:09.949
be counted.

00:05:09.949 --> 00:05:11.199
You can look at that.

00:05:11.199 --> 00:05:19.449
And then one the last one was an error where
a juniors vote was counted as the senior imagine,

00:05:19.449 --> 00:05:23.610
you know, David Pakman junior, although Jews
don't do the junior thing.

00:05:23.610 --> 00:05:29.840
Imagine David Pakman David Pakman senior is
dead, David Pakman Junior is alive and votes,

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:33.830
and the vote is counted wrongly as if it was
David Pakman senior.

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:35.699
Still, only one vote, right?

00:05:35.699 --> 00:05:39.419
It was counted as the wrong person, but it's
still only one vote.

00:05:39.419 --> 00:05:42.960
That's what was found when BBC actually investigated
this.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:46.259
So don't fall for the fact that it's happening
when it's not.

00:05:46.259 --> 00:05:49.939
And more importantly, even if they were able
to prove that it's happening, they would also

00:05:49.939 --> 00:05:54.729
have to prove that it's happening in a Partizan
way such that it would actually help one candidate

00:05:54.729 --> 00:06:37.800
defeat another in even a single state, which
they've 

00:06:37.800 --> 00:07:08.150
not recognized.

